	title: "Exploration Without Getting Completely Lost"
	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["18C0AF7F5C17CAB7"]
			description: [
				"Nature's Compass locates biomes; Explorer's Compass locates structures. Search ranges are limited, and exploration still generates chunks, so coordinate with the team."
				"Nature's Compass searches for a selected biome while Explorer's Compass searches registered structures. Choose the exact target, allow the scan to finish, and remember that a missing result can mean the target is outside the configured search range."
				"A compass points toward a destination but does not make the intervening chunks free to generate. Coordinate searches, travel one route together where possible, mark the successful location, and avoid repeated wide scans for places the team already knows."
			]
			id: "6851604085D9D68D"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2EDB301AC6BB0863"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
