		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6851604085D9D68D"]
			description: [
				"Warp Stones are reusable with cooldowns; scrolls are consumable. Keep one escape option in your backpack before entering a new dimension."
				"Waystones must be activated before they become reliable destinations. Name them by place and dimension, keep the arrival area safe, and carry a scroll or Warp Stone when an expedition cannot assume the destination chunk is convenient."
				"Storage should have layers: backpack for the road, drawers for bulk, ordinary labelled containers for unique objects, and a searchable terminal across the room. One giant unsorted network only hides disorder behind a search bar."
			]
			id: "133E40031AC9FB97"
			rewards: [{
