			title: "Lootr and Shared Treasure"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4F7A5E294B48D343"]
			description: [
				"A locked arena, unusual altar, trophy display or dramatic health bar is a threshold. Stop, regroup and research the mod before crossing it."
				"Prepare spare equipment and decide whether defeat can damage the world or strand players. Never assume a new boss behaves like a stronger zombie."
				"Activate the encounter only when everyone who wants to participate is present and ready."
				"Mark entrances, cleared routes, dangerous branches, and exits differently. Bring spare blocks and a water bucket, retreat to a secured room when inventory fills, and never let loot pressure erase the return path."
			]
			id: "3A8709849D637D3D"
