		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A8709849D637D3D"]
			description: [
				"Open the Curios interface and learn its slots. Artifacts and Relics may require a specific slot, activation input, charge, cooldown or condition before their effect appears."
				"Test one item at a time in a safe place. Overlapping movement, vision or defensive effects can hide which relic is helping or causing trouble."
				"Build loadouts around a task instead of wearing every rare object because it is rare."
				"Curios adds equipment slots outside normal armour. Open its interface, read each item's slot tooltip, and compare effects in a safe place; an unequipped treasure provides no benefit and a bad combination can obscure its own cause."
			]
			id: "6416430518B427C3"
			rewards: [{
