		{
			dependencies: ["3A8709849D637D3D"]
			description: [
				"Naturalist animals have behaviours worth observing. Use a Bug Net and camera rather than killing unfamiliar creatures for no reason."
				"Naturalist, Alex's Mobs, Critters and Companions, aquatic mods, and Friends and Foes reward observation. Watch movement and sound, consult an animal dictionary when available, and avoid killing an unfamiliar creature merely to identify it."
				"Once the method works, label its inputs, outputs, controls, route, or habitat in plain language and show one teammate. Shared documentation turns a completed quest into knowledge that remains useful when the original player is offline."
			]
			id: "1CA7ED993BDE8D70"
